# mutgap4_res_compute_pipeline_forced: The compute counterpart of mutgap3_res_render_pipeline_forced_taken and _forced_index (a placed compute pipeline is made with setForceResourceIndex:YES): three ICB-capable compute pipelines, P (zero entry), Q (entry {1, 1}) and S (entry {5, 5}), dispatched in that order in one exec, so P is made first and writes the index and ID Metal gives it, Q is made at index 1 by force and S at the free index 5. Each dispatch writes its output. Measured: P is given {1, 1}, Q is made at index 1 too ({1, 1}, as the render pipelines were), S at {5, 5}. Host-keyed (the driver's indices).
